    <briefdescription>
<para>Heuristic <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1training_1_1_i_a_i_judge" kindref="compound">IAIJudge</ref> that evaluates responses without an LLM. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses response length, lexical diversity, and a keyword blacklist as a lightweight quality proxy. Designed for testing and environments where no LLM runtime is available.</para>
<para>Performance: O(|response_a| + |response_b|). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
